---
globs: backend/src/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- NestJS layout: controllers stay thin; business logic lives in services (`auth/`, `services/`, `users/`).
- Validate request bodies with class-validator DTOs in `dto/` folders. Do not accept untyped `any` bodies on new endpoints.
- AI generation goes through `AIService` and prompt builders—do not call LM Studio from controllers.
- Add or update Jest specs under `backend/src/test/` for new services and controllers. Run `npm test` in `backend/`.
- Config defaults live in @backend/src/services/lm-studio-config.ts
